# systemd-sysusers(5) declaration for the spoloh service account.
#
# Install alongside the service unit, e.g. by copying this file to
# /usr/lib/sysusers.d/spoloh.conf (or /etc/sysusers.d/spoloh.conf for a local
# override) and running:
#
#   systemd-sysusers spoloh.conf
#
# This must run before deploy/spoloh.service is first started: that unit's
# User=spoloh has no other way to come into existence, and ProtectHome=true /
# ProtectSystem=full in the unit leave no room to create it as a side effect
# of starting the service.
#
# Type Name   ID  GECOS                       Home directory
u     spoloh  -   "Spoloh alert announcer"    /var/lib/spoloh
# Grants the aplay/amixer access the audio group carries; matches Group=audio
# in the unit.
m     spoloh  audio
